    "body": "so the game has this thing where you hold aim and it locks on to a nearby animal and gives you the info and button prompts in the button right. if you can detect that, it should be treated the same as the point-weapon aim tagging. no \"must be looking at the thing within this distance of the screen center\" (i forget the name) limits nor distance limits. long as the game puts you into that mode on an animal then you're tagging/studying it.\n\nonly do this if you can detect the mode\n\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6eac8c93-ed26-4d14-a668-19afd1622a2f\" />",
